			"notes": "This mod is designed for Minecraft 1.20.1 and 1.21.1\n\nNew Features:\n\n- Rule system\n- Visual editors\n- Auto-load `.flow` and `.rule` files on startup\n- Text placeholders can handle nested styles\n- Messages can fall back to a redacted version for players who are not the intended recipient\n- Bug fix\n\nSee full Changelog in README.md"
